<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --green:      #7dbf41;
    --dark-green: #1a231f;
    --white:      #ffffff;
    --concrete:   #6b756e;
    --spot-gray:  #f2f2f2;
    --sup-gray:   #e7e7e7;
    --c-content:  #185FA5;
    --c-sales:    #1D9E75;
    --c-interna:  #C8900A;
    --c-produto:  #6B55CC;
    --c-branding: #C44A1A;
  }
  body { font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; background: var(--spot-gray); color: var(--dark-green); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; min-height: 100vh; }

  header { background: var(--dark-green); padding: 28px 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .logo-mark { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
  .logo-wordmark { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .report-badge { background: var(--green); color: var(--dark-green); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 2px; }

  .hero { background: var(--dark-green); padding: 48px 48px 56px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--green); }
  .hero-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .hero-title { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--white); line-height: 1.2; max-width: 600px; }
  .hero-title strong { font-weight: 700; color: var(--green); }
  .hero-meta { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--concrete); display: flex; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-meta span strong { color: var(--white); font-weight: 500; }

  main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 48px 80px; }

  .section-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--concrete); margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .section-label::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--sup-gray); }

  .metric-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .metric-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px 18px 18px; border-top: 3px solid var(--green); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .metric-card::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--spot-gray); transform: translate(16px,16px); }
  .metric-card .area-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .metric-card .pct { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark-green); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .metric-card .lbl { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--dark-green); margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .metric-card .cnt { font-size: 11px; color: var(--concrete); }

  .chart-container { background: var(--white); border-radius: 4px; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .chart-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
  .chart-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--dark-green); }
  .chart-subtitle { font-size: 12px; color: var(--concrete); margin-top: 2px; }
  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
  .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--concrete); }
  .legend-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .chart-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 320px; }

  .table-container { background: var(--white); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .table-header { background: var(--dark-green); padding: 18px 24px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  thead tr { background: var(--spot-gray); }
  thead th { padding: 12px 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--concrete); text-align: right; }
  thead th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sup-gray); }
  tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: var(--spot-gray); }
  tbody td { padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--dark-green); text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  tbody td:first-child { text-align: left; }
  .area-cell { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .area-dot-sm { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .area-name { font-weight: 500; }
  td.peak { font-weight: 700; }
  td.peak::after { content: '▲'; font-size: 8px; color: var(--green); margin-left: 4px; vertical-align: middle; }
  .total-row td { font-size: 11px; color: var(--concrete); background: var(--spot-gray); font-weight: 400; }

  .stacked-section { background: var(--white); border-radius: 4px; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .quarter-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .quarter-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark-green); width: 64px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .stacked-bar { flex: 1; height: 32px; display: flex; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
  .stacked-seg { height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; min-width: 0; }
  .quarter-total { font-size: 11px; color: var(--concrete); width: 64px; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }

  .insights-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .insight-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 4px; padding: 24px; border-left: 3px solid var(--green); }
  .insight-card.alert { border-left-color: var(--c-sales); }
  .insight-card.neutral { border-left-color: var(--concrete); }
  .insight-card.note { border-left-color: var(--c-interna); }
  .insight-tag { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .insight-card.alert .insight-tag { color: var(--c-sales); }
  .insight-card.neutral .insight-tag { color: var(--concrete); }
  .insight-card.note .insight-tag { color: var(--c-interna); }
  .insight-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark-green); margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .insight-body { font-size: 13px; color: var(--concrete); line-height: 1.65; }

  /* PEOPLE */
  .people-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .person-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 4px; padding: 24px; }
  .person-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .person-avatar { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--dark-green); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--green); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .person-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark-green); }
  .person-total { font-size: 11px; color: var(--concrete); margin-top: 2px; }
  .person-bars { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .pbar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .pbar-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--concrete); width: 116px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .pbar-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .pbar-track { flex: 1; background: var(--spot-gray); border-radius: 2px; height: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  .pbar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; }
  .pbar-pct { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark-green); width: 36px; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* PEOPLE TABLE */
  .people-table-wrap { background: var(--white); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .people-table-wrap table thead th { text-align: center; }
  .people-table-wrap table thead th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  .people-table-wrap table tbody td { text-align: center; }
  .people-table-wrap table tbody td:first-child { text-align: left; }
  .cell-bar { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px; }
  .cell-pct { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--dark-green); }
  .cell-mini { height: 5px; border-radius: 2px; min-width: 2px; }

  footer { background: var(--dark-green); padding: 24px 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .footer-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--concrete); }
  .footer-brand { font-size: 11px; color: var(--concrete); }
  .footer-brand strong { color: var(--green); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    header, .hero, main, footer { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
    .metric-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .insights-grid, .people-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-title { font-size: 26px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">
    <svg class="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="17" stroke="#7dbf41" stroke-width="2"></circle>
      <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="10" stroke="#7dbf41" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 3"></circle>
      <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="4" fill="#7dbf41"></circle>
    </svg>
    <span class="logo-wordmark">Bring IT</span>
  </div>
  <span class="report-badge">Marketing Report</span>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <p class="hero-label">Distribuição de Tasks por Área</p>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Marketing Effort<br><strong>Quarter a Quarter</strong></h1>
  <div class="hero-meta">
    <span><strong>Período</strong> Q1 2025 — Q1 2026</span>
    <span><strong>Tasks classificadas</strong> 1.963</span>
    <span><strong>Áreas</strong> 5</span>
    <span><strong>Fonte</strong> Notion · Marketing Board</span>
  </div>
</div>

<main>

  <!-- VISÃO GERAL -->
  <p class="section-label">Visão geral consolidada</p>
  <div class="metric-grid">
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="area-dot" style="background:var(--c-content);"></div>
      <div class="pct">43.9%</div>
      <div class="lbl">Conteúdo</div>
      <div class="cnt">862 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="area-dot" style="background:var(--c-sales);"></div>
      <div class="pct">23.1%</div>
      <div class="lbl">Sales</div>
      <div class="cnt">453 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="area-dot" style="background:var(--c-interna);"></div>
      <div class="pct">15.8%</div>
      <div class="lbl">Com. Interna</div>
      <div class="cnt">310 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="area-dot" style="background:var(--c-branding);"></div>
      <div class="pct">11.5%</div>
      <div class="lbl">Branding</div>
      <div class="cnt">225 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="area-dot" style="background:var(--c-produto);"></div>
      <div class="pct">5.8%</div>
      <div class="lbl">Produto</div>
      <div class="cnt">113 tasks</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LINE CHART -->
  <div class="chart-container">
    <div class="chart-header">
      <div>
        <div class="chart-title">Evolução por quarter (%)</div>
        <div class="chart-subtitle">Percentual de tasks classificadas em cada área, por período</div>
      </div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-content);"></span>Conteúdo</span>
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-sales);"></span>Sales</span>
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-interna);"></span>Com. Interna</span>
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-branding);"></span>Branding</span>
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-produto);"></span>Produto</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-wrap">
      <canvas id="lineChart" role="img" aria-label="Evolução das 5 áreas de marketing de Q1 2025 a Q1 2026." width="940" height="320" style="display: block; box-sizing: border-box; height: 320px; width: 940px;"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STACKED BARS -->
  <div class="stacked-section">
    <div class="chart-header" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
      <div>
        <div class="chart-title">Composição por quarter</div>
        <div class="chart-subtitle">Proporção relativa de cada área dentro do período</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Q1 2025: Conteúdo 23.4, Sales 33.9, Com.Interna 24.5, Branding 13.6, Produto 4.5 -->
    <div class="quarter-row">
      <div class="quarter-label">Q1 2025</div>
      <div class="stacked-bar">
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:33.9%;background:var(--c-sales);" title="Sales 33.9%">Sales 34%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:24.5%;background:var(--c-interna);" title="Com.Interna 24.5%">Int. 25%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:23.4%;background:var(--c-content);" title="Conteúdo 23.4%">Cont. 23%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:13.6%;background:var(--c-branding);" title="Branding 13.6%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:4.5%;background:var(--c-produto);" title="Produto 4.5%"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quarter-total">286 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Q2 2025: Conteúdo 18.8, Sales 23.8, Com.Interna 27.8, Branding 14.8, Produto 14.8 -->
    <div class="quarter-row">
      <div class="quarter-label">Q2 2025</div>
      <div class="stacked-bar">
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:27.8%;background:var(--c-interna);" title="Com.Interna 27.8%">Int. 28%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:23.8%;background:var(--c-sales);" title="Sales 23.8%">Sales 24%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:18.8%;background:var(--c-content);" title="Conteúdo 18.8%">Cont.</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:14.8%;background:var(--c-branding);" title="Branding 14.8%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:14.8%;background:var(--c-produto);" title="Produto 14.8%"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quarter-total">277 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Q3 2025: Conteúdo 40.4, Sales 45.6, Com.Interna 6.5, Branding 2.3, Produto 5.3 -->
    <div class="quarter-row">
      <div class="quarter-label">Q3 2025</div>
      <div class="stacked-bar">
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:45.6%;background:var(--c-sales);" title="Sales 45.6%">Sales 46%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:40.4%;background:var(--c-content);" title="Conteúdo 40.4%">Conteúdo 40%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:6.5%;background:var(--c-interna);" title="Com.Interna 6.5%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:5.3%;background:var(--c-produto);" title="Produto 5.3%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:2.3%;background:var(--c-branding);" title="Branding 2.3%"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quarter-total">399 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Q4 2025: Conteúdo 59.1, Sales 29.3, Com.Interna 3.4, Branding 3.0, Produto 5.2 -->
    <div class="quarter-row">
      <div class="quarter-label">Q4 2025</div>
      <div class="stacked-bar">
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:59.1%;background:var(--c-content);" title="Conteúdo 59.1%">Conteúdo 59%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:29.3%;background:var(--c-sales);" title="Sales 29.3%">Sales 29%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:5.2%;background:var(--c-produto);" title="Produto 5.2%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:3.4%;background:var(--c-interna);" title="Com.Interna 3.4%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:3.0%;background:var(--c-branding);" title="Branding 3.0%"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quarter-total">232 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Q1 2026: Conteúdo 72.8, Sales 8.3, Com.Interna 12.4, Branding 1.2, Produto 5.3 -->
    <div class="quarter-row">
      <div class="quarter-label">Q1 2026</div>
      <div class="stacked-bar">
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:72.8%;background:var(--c-content);" title="Conteúdo 72.8%">Conteúdo 73%</div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:12.4%;background:var(--c-interna);" title="Com.Interna 12.4%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:8.3%;background:var(--c-sales);" title="Sales 8.3%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:5.3%;background:var(--c-produto);" title="Produto 5.3%"></div>
        <div class="stacked-seg" style="width:1.2%;background:var(--c-branding);" title="Branding 1.2%"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quarter-total">169 tasks</div>
    </div>
    <div class="legend" style="margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--sup-gray);">
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-content);"></span>Conteúdo</span>
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-sales);"></span>Sales</span>
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-interna);"></span>Com. Interna</span>
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-branding);"></span>Branding</span>
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-produto);"></span>Produto</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TABLE QUARTER -->
  <div class="table-container">
    <div class="table-header">Tabela detalhada — % por área e quarter</div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Área</th><th>Q1 2025</th><th>Q2 2025</th><th>Q3 2025</th><th>Q4 2025</th><th>Q1 2026</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="area-cell"><span class="area-dot-sm" style="background:var(--c-content);"></span><span class="area-name">Conteúdo</span></span></td>
          <td>23.4%</td><td>18.8%</td><td>40.4%</td><td>59.1%</td><td class="peak">72.8%</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="area-cell"><span class="area-dot-sm" style="background:var(--c-sales);"></span><span class="area-name">Sales</span></span></td>
          <td>33.9%</td><td>23.8%</td><td class="peak">45.6%</td><td>29.3%</td><td>8.3%</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="area-cell"><span class="area-dot-sm" style="background:var(--c-interna);"></span><span class="area-name">Com. Interna</span></span></td>
          <td>24.5%</td><td class="peak">27.8%</td><td>6.5%</td><td>3.4%</td><td>12.4%</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="area-cell"><span class="area-dot-sm" style="background:var(--c-branding);"></span><span class="area-name">Branding</span></span></td>
          <td>13.6%</td><td class="peak">14.8%</td><td>2.3%</td><td>3.0%</td><td>1.2%</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="area-cell"><span class="area-dot-sm" style="background:var(--c-produto);"></span><span class="area-name">Produto</span></span></td>
          <td>4.5%</td><td class="peak">14.8%</td><td>5.3%</td><td>5.2%</td><td>5.3%</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="total-row">
          <td>Tasks classificadas</td>
          <td>286</td><td>277</td><td>399</td><td>232</td><td>169</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- INSIGHTS -->
  <p class="section-label">Interpretação dos dados</p>
  <div class="insights-grid">
    <div class="insight-card">
      <div class="insight-tag">Tendência principal</div>
      <div class="insight-title">Conteúdo em crescimento consistente — de 23% para 73%</div>
      <div class="insight-body">A única área com trajetória de alta ininterrupta. Social media, blog e website viraram o centro de gravidade da operação a partir do Q3 2025, chegando a quase 3 em cada 4 tasks no Q1 2026.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="insight-card alert">
      <div class="insight-tag">Ponto de atenção</div>
      <div class="insight-title">Sales: pico no Q3 2025 (46%) e queda para 8% no Q1 2026</div>
      <div class="insight-body">A maior oscilação do dataset. O Q3 2025 concentrou o maior volume total (399 tasks) com Sales dominando. A queda abrupta para 8% no Q1 2026 pode sinalizar um gap real de suporte comercial.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="insight-card neutral">
